; Ground clutter: mushrooms, rocks, bushes and plants (Deco 01-15) at high
; weight, pumpkins/bones (12-15) as rare finds -- weighting is done by
; simply repeating the common entries in this array; SceneryScatter's own
; algorithm (unchanged) already picks uniformly at random from it.
